# ai&'s plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-aiand-setting-api-key = 在 https://console.aiand.com 的“Settings > API Keys > Create”中创建的 ai& API 密钥（以 sk- 开头）。密钥仅显示一次。

## The report: the money spent over the 30 days ai& keeps request logs.

usage-aiand-spend = 最近 30 天支出
# The same, when only the newest pages of logs were summed.
usage-aiand-spend-partial = 最近 30 天支出（部分）
